Rama embraces Sita and seeks Sharabhanga --- Rama sees Indra blazing unsullied above earth --- Rama notes gods horses youths and sky-chariot --- Indra avoids Rama and departs heavenward --- Rama grasps Sharabhanga's feet with Sita --- Sharabhanga offers won worlds which Rama declines --- Sharabhanga enters fire and rises youthful --- Sage ascends past gods to Brahmaloka --- Brahma welcomes arrived brahmarshi gladly